    },
    "**A hardware keyboard** types on %@ by itself, Esc included, and **Keyboard** then brings up the keyboard bar." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；插值为Mac 名称；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**外接键盘**可直接在 %@ 上输入，包括 Esc；此时**键盘**会调出键盘栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**A hardware keyboard** types on %@ by itself, Esc included, and **the keyboard key** then brings up the keyboard bar." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；插值为Mac 名称；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**外接键盘**可直接在 %@ 上输入，包括 Esc；此时**键盘键**会调出键盘栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Apple Pencil** works as a mouse." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Apple Pencil** 可用作鼠标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Apps** lists the apps on %@. Choose an open one again for its next window." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；插值为Mac 名称；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**应用**会列出 %@ 上的应用。再次选择已打开的应用即可切换到它的下一个窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Apps** lists the apps on %@: tap an open one again for its next window." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；插值为Mac 名称；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**应用**会列出 %@ 上的应用：再次轻点已打开的应用即可切换到它的下一个窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Disconnect** is at the bottom of Settings." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**断开连接**位于设置底部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Drag** to scroll." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**拖移**以滚动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Each app icon** switches to its most recent window. Choose the current app again for its next window. Actions list its windows and let you close, minimize or go full screen. The current app comes first, followed by recently used apps." : {
      "comment" : "横屏精简顶栏的 VoiceOver 导览；双星号标出应用图标",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**每个应用图标**都会切换到该应用最近使用的窗口。再次选择当前应用可切换到它的下一个窗口。操作菜单会列出各窗口，并让你关闭、最小化或全屏显示。当前应用排在首位，随后是最近使用的应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Each window** has actions: close, minimize, full screen, and move left or right. Swipe up or down to hear them." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**每个窗口**都有这些操作：关闭、最小化、全屏以及向左或向右移动。向上或向下轻扫即可听取这些操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Hold to Show Window Controls** sets how long you hold a window’s thumbnail before its controls show." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**按住显示窗口控制**可设置按住窗口缩略图多久后显示窗口控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Hold your %@ upright** for a trackpad and keys." : {
      "comment" : "导览竖放设备的提示；插值为设备类型，双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**将你的 %@ 竖放**，即可使用触控板和按键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Keyboard** brings up the on-screen keyboard to type on %@." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；插值为Mac 名称；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**键盘**会调出屏幕键盘，让你在 %@ 上输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Larger Picture**, in Settings: a window’s picture takes the place of the thumbnails and reaches down to where the keyboard comes up." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置中的**更大画面**会用窗口画面取代缩略图，并将画面向下扩展到键盘弹出的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Menus** has the menu bar of the app you’re using on %@." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；插值为Mac 名称；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**菜单**中有你正在 %@ 上使用的应用的菜单栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Pinch** to zoom the picture here, up to 5×. Zoomed in, two fingers move it, and one finger still taps, holds and drags on %@." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；插值为Mac 名称；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**捏合**可缩放这里的画面，最高放大至 5 倍。放大后，用双指移动画面，单指仍可在 %@ 上轻点、按住和拖移。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Reverse Scrolling** turns a finger’s drag and the on-screen trackpad’s two-finger scroll around." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**反向滚动**会反转单指拖移和屏幕触控板双指滚动的方向。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Send Audio**, a beta, plays %@’s sound here, and **Mute** silences this %@ alone." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；插值为Mac 名称、设备类型；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "**Send Audio**, a beta, plays %1$@’s sound here, and **Mute** silences this %2$@ alone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试版功能**发送声音**可在这里播放 %@ 的声音，而**静音**只会将这台 %@ 静音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Swipe with three fingers**: up for Mission Control, down for App Exposé, and sideways between Spaces." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**用三指轻扫**：向上打开 Mission Control，向下打开 App Exposé，横向轻扫可在桌面空间之间切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Take the Tour** is there too, to see this again." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "那里还有**使用导览**，可再次查看这些说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Tap an app icon** for its most recent window; tap the current app again for its next window. Touch and hold to choose a window, close, minimize or go full screen. The current app comes first, followed by recently used apps." : {
      "comment" : "横屏精简顶栏导览；双星号标出应用图标点按操作",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**轻点应用图标**可打开该应用最近使用的窗口；再次轻点当前应用可切换到它的下一个窗口。按住可选择窗口，或关闭、最小化、全屏显示窗口。当前应用排在首位，随后是最近使用的应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Tap with two fingers** on the trackpad to right-click." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在触控板上**用双指轻点**即可右键点按。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Tap** to click." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**轻点**即可点按。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**The keyboard key** brings up the on-screen keyboard to type on %@." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；插值为Mac 名称；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**键盘键**会调出屏幕键盘，让你在 %@ 上输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Touch and hold** a window to close, minimize or go full screen. Keep holding and drag to move it." : {
      "comment" : "串流导览文案；双星号标出强调文字",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
