          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Virtual Display** is on: a window you pick streams from a display of its own on %@, so it keeps updating when something covers it; **Aa** then sizes its text." : {
      "comment" : "导览虚拟显示器说明；插值为 Mac 名称，双星号标出控件名称",
