    },
    "Beta. Every connected device hears what streams, and %@ keeps playing it too. Mute silences it on this %@ alone; %@ keeps sending and playing it." : {
      "comment" : "主机设置面板：声音开关和静音说明，插值为 Mac 名称和设备类型",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta. Every connected device hears what streams, and %1$@ keeps playing it too. Mute silences it on this %2$@ alone; %3$@ keeps sending and playing it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试版。每台已连接设备都能听到串流内容的声音，%@ 也会继续播放。静音只会将这台 %@ 静音；%@ 会继续发送和播放声音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beta. Every connected device hears what streams, and %@ keeps playing it too. Mute silences it on this %@ alone; %@ keeps sending and playing it. This %@ is muted." : {
      "comment" : "主机设置面板：声音开关和静音说明，插值为 Mac 名称和设备类型",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta. Every connected device hears what streams, and %1$@ keeps playing it too. Mute silences it on this %2$@ alone; %3$@ keeps sending and playing it. This %4$@ is muted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试版。每台已连接设备都能听到串流内容的声音，%@ 也会继续播放。静音只会将这台 %@ 静音；%@ 会继续发送和播放声音。这台 %@ 已静音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beta. Turn this on to hear what streams on every connected device; %@ keeps playing it too. Mute silences it on this %@ alone; %@ keeps sending and playing it." : {
      "comment" : "主机设置面板：声音开关和静音说明，插值为 Mac 名称和设备类型",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
