        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试版。开启后，每台已连接设备都能听到串流内容的声音；%@ 也会继续播放。静音只会将这台 %@ 静音；%@ 会继续发送和播放声音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beta. Turn this on to hear what streams on every connected device; %@ keeps playing it too. Mute silences it on this %@ alone; %@ keeps sending and playing it. This %@ is muted." : {
