          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets devices reach %@ without a shared Wi‑Fi network, the way AirDrop does. While it’s on, streaming over Wi‑Fi can stutter. This %@ is connected directly: turning this off disconnects it." : {
      "comment" : "主机设置面板：直接无线连接说明及断线提醒，插值为 Mac 名称和设备类型",
