          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Lets devices reach %1$@ without a shared Wi‑Fi network, the way AirDrop does. While it’s on, streaming over Wi‑Fi can stutter. This %2$@ is connected directly: turning this off disconnects it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让设备无需连接同一 Wi‑Fi 网络即可连接 %@，原理与 AirDrop 相同。开启后，通过 Wi‑Fi 串流时可能会卡顿。这台 %@ 正在直连，关闭此选项会使其断开连接。"
