    },
    "This isn’t the %@ this %@ paired with. If Sill was set up again on it, forget it here and pair again." : {
      "comment" : "连接页远程连接失败提示，插值为Mac 名称、设备类型",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This isn’t the %1$@ this %2$@ paired with. If Sill was set up again on it, forget it here and pair again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这不是这台 %2$@ 配对过的 %1$@。如果在该 Mac 上重新设置过 Sill，请在这里忽略它，然后重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three fingers on the trackpad or over the stream. While a window streams, a gesture shows the Desktop first, and the opposite gesture closes what one opened. %@ does these with its own keyboard shortcuts: one turned off in its Keyboard settings does nothing." : {
      "comment" : "主机设置面板：手势说明，插值为 Mac 名称",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在触控板或串流画面上使用三根手指。窗口串流时，手势会先显示桌面，反向手势则会关闭之前由手势打开的界面。%@ 通过自身的键盘快捷键执行这些操作：如果在其键盘设置中关闭了某个快捷键，对应手势就不会生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three fingers on the trackpad or over the stream. While a window streams, a gesture shows the Desktop first, and the opposite gesture closes what one opened. %@ does these with its own keyboard shortcuts: one turned off in its Keyboard settings does nothing. Four-finger swipes and a Magic Keyboard trackpad’s gestures stay with iPadOS." : {
      "comment" : "主机设置面板：iPad 的手势说明，插值为 Mac 名称",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在触控板或串流画面上使用三根手指。窗口串流时，手势会先显示桌面，反向手势则会关闭之前由手势打开的界面。%@ 通过自身的键盘快捷键执行这些操作：如果在其键盘设置中关闭了某个快捷键，对应手势就不会生效。四指轻扫和 Magic Keyboard 触控板手势仍由 iPadOS 处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three-Finger Gestures" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "三指手势"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three-finger strokes do nothing while this is off." : {
      "comment" : "主机设置面板：三指手势关闭时的说明",
