        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音输入未成功。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceOver keeps three-finger gestures for itself, so the rows above do them on %@ instead. While a window streams, a gesture shows the Desktop first, and the opposite gesture closes what one opened. %@ does these with its own keyboard shortcuts: one turned off in its Keyboard settings does nothing." : {
      "comment" : "主机设置面板：VoiceOver 手势说明，插值为 Mac 名称",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "VoiceOver keeps three-finger gestures for itself, so the rows above do them on %1$@ instead. While a window streams, a gesture shows the Desktop first, and the opposite gesture closes what one opened. %2$@ does these with its own keyboard shortcuts: one turned off in its Keyboard settings does nothing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VoiceOver 会占用三指手势，因此请通过上方各行在 %@ 上执行这些操作。窗口串流时，手势会先显示桌面，反向手势则会关闭之前由手势打开的界面。%@ 通过自身的键盘快捷键执行这些操作：如果在其键盘设置中关闭了某个快捷键，对应手势就不会生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceOver keeps three-finger gestures for itself, so the rows above do them on %@ instead. While a window streams, a gesture shows the Desktop first, and the opposite gesture closes what one opened. %@ does these with its own keyboard shortcuts: one turned off in its Keyboard settings does nothing. Four-finger swipes and a Magic Keyboard trackpad’s gestures stay with iPadOS." : {
      "comment" : "主机设置面板：iPad 的 VoiceOver 手势说明，插值为 Mac 名称",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "VoiceOver keeps three-finger gestures for itself, so the rows above do them on %1$@ instead. While a window streams, a gesture shows the Desktop first, and the opposite gesture closes what one opened. %2$@ does these with its own keyboard shortcuts: one turned off in its Keyboard settings does nothing. Four-finger swipes and a Magic Keyboard trackpad’s gestures stay with iPadOS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VoiceOver 会占用三指手势，因此请通过上方各行在 %@ 上执行这些操作。窗口串流时，手势会先显示桌面，反向手势则会关闭之前由手势打开的界面。%@ 通过自身的键盘快捷键执行这些操作：如果在其键盘设置中关闭了某个快捷键，对应手势就不会生效。四指轻扫和 Magic Keyboard 触控板手势仍由 iPadOS 处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
